      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹4.06 (vs ₹3.29 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹4.06 (up from ₹3.29 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹5.20b (up 13% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹235.2m (up 23% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 4.5% (up from 4.1% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 50% per year but the company’s share price has only fallen by 38% per year, which means it has not declined as severely as earnings.",
